"""Retired builder: link.html is now the authored ForeignTwin carrier.

Find is a working set of actual source contracts. Understand reads their live
owner projections. Distribute exports an inert plan. Connect reports only real
promotion/claim/edge standing. No stage in this page creates authority.
"""

